    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero tari burumburiít baraá Hebroni dír Daudi, kway báy, «Ga/aaweek, atén a slaqwatók nee aa tseereerók ar kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadá' Saulo tawa waawutmo, kuúng slaqwaruusér Israeli ana geerahát baraá slaqwaraaro. Nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók kuúng uri báy, ‹Kuúng a de'eemusmoó muk'eé' oo Israeli, nee kuúng tari geeraharusmoó muk'eé' oo Israeli.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo bariisér múk Israeli sleémeero tay daqáy dír waawutmo Daudi baraá Hebroni. Inós alqado giri oó' dir'ín geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale. Inós kway iimbalaáx as tawa waawutmoó múk Israeli, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó' dír Samueli.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nee múk Israeli sleémeero tari tláy gixsár Yerusalemu. Qoomaadae Yerusalemu ka bay Yebusi nee yaamuloouuse a múk Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuloouusér Yebusi Daudi ngway bayé', «Kuúng a datká baraaká'.» Ala Daudi gixsadá' koo/i gawit ar Siyoni gari hayóh, gixsadá' kari báy, «Gixsár Daudi.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kár Daudi iri káh, «Heé geera oo múk Yebusi gwaa tsitsiihh ku geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér wa qaas.» Naagáy heé geera tay Yoabu garmoó Seruya, inós kway heé úr wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi iri hotaá áy baraadaá gixsár koo/i gawit, gawaá adoorihe didá' kay báy, «Gixsár Daudi.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gixsadá' gay tleéhh bihhe sleémeerowo, ngina iimír Milór wa iimu/ún, gay harweér. Yoabu yaameedá' aa hhiturumit ar gixsadá' gari alhhe'eés slukiiriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi /uuru gway sláy baraá uraywose, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo a dinkwa nee inós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' an geeraharuusér miguusér Daudi, kudá' ngwaa alee/isiye' baraá waawuti'iimarose, dinkwa nee múk Israeli sleémeero kudá' inós gwaa waawutmoó wa qaas ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó' daanduú múk Israeliwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miguusér Daudi a tí: Yashobeamu oo tlahhoó Hakmoni, geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér mibeeri tám.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mibeeri tám:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baraá gooi bahh'alé ar bál geeraawo gár taa gooín a kudá' tám (2 Sam 23:8).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inós múk tsiire tám guna tsuú/ ar lawaala baraá slaqwarár wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé hatlá' baraá tla/ángw miguuseedá' tame, a Eleasari garmoó Dodo, oo tlahhoó Ahohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looarka wake inós nee Daudi ta dinkwár i dirii' baraá Pas-damimu. Qoomaadae múk Filisti taa burumburiyé' as slaqwara, amoodae qaymór aanganoó yaariír oo shayiri i deer. Múk Israeli tari geeraá múk Filistír wa goów. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Eleasari nee Daudi tari baraá tla/ángw qaymoodá' wa siinootín as tawa slaqwi, nee múk Filisti kuri tsuú/, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ giri tuú/, giri baalír úr i haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo miguusér tám baraá tla/ángw tidá' mibeeri tame tindina aweér tlaa/aaro, Daudi kuri amór mar'ír Adulamu i áy, qoomaadae slaqwaruusér múk Filisti xafaay ngwa tleehhiyé' baraá xatstá Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae Daudi i baraá gixsár koo/ír gawít i dirii', slaqwaruusér múk Filisti gixsár Betilehemu ngaa i dahiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi iri oó', «A slaá' hee ma'aá wahangw'eé' ngiwa hheeki baraá hhalangwdá' bihhaá afkú gixsár Betelehemúr i dirií'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo miguuseedá' tám tari tláy tay waaraáhh ar baraá tla/ángw xafoó múk Filisti, ma'aay ngay iihheekiyé' baraá hhaalangwduú Betilehemúr wa ale, ngay huwiyé' amór Daudi. Ala inós ma'aydá' gaa wahiiká. Ma'aydá' gina ku'uús as tawa ilahhooa dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iri oó', «Munguúeé', adoosíng ma'ayká' ngiwa wah, ngi pa/asi dir'eene. Xáy, aqo qiítla tseerér mukwí ngiwa wah? Kuká' ma'ayká' ngaa hheekiye' ar slafingw'ín nguwa baraá tsaxwí dahaás.» Gawaá adoorihe ma'ayká' inós gaa wahiiká. Muruuwí an kudá' miguuseedá' tám aa tlehhít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai hhiyoó Yoabu sleeme a geeraharusmo oo slaqwaruusér mibeeri tám. Inós ina slaáqw ar lawaala múk tsiire tám guri tsuú/. Inós sleeme kuna harafaár baraá tla/ángw miguuseedá' tame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós aa iiatleerúy baraá tla/ángw miguuseedá' mibeeraá tám, inós kway geeraharusmooín wa qaás, ala adór miguuseedá' tám gaa ayká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, garmoó Yehoyada, oo Kabse'eli inós a migusmo muruú waa/oo/amo guna tlehhiít. Inós sleeme daaqoó tsár oo Arieli oo Moabu guna tsuú/. Sleeme diraangw guna haraadáh baraá bohoongw qoomaadár tsaaqwaaro gway gaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme heeko oo yaamaá Misri guna gaás, heé tlenaango miíta tsár, lawaalár yangaariir ga kón dakose, harmahaywós uraywo a adór xa'anoó",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Xa'anoó ta inqwarúr tlehhahhiti:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A slaqás nee difiitamo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ta inqwarúr tlehhahhiti. Ala Benaya guri i haratláy ar hhara, lawaalarós tidá' gari hayóh, heewuú Misri guri gaás ar lawaalarós ar kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
